F) Server-Based AAA using TACACS+ — Router 2
Packet Tracer server step: Services → TACACS+ Server → AAA; switch the service on, enter the client IP and password, and set the username/password.
r2>en
r2#conf t
r2(config)#username admin secret admin123
r2(config)#tacacs-server host 192.168.2.2
r2(config)#tacacs-server key pwdr2
r2(config)#aaa new-model
r2(config)#aaa authentication login default group tacacs+ local
r2(config)#line console 0
r2(config-line)#login authentication default
